# CodeMind-Hub
新一代开源极简 AI 编程桌面工作台。

当前阶段：**Phase 0 - 产品需求定义与前端 UI/UX 原型验证**

## 🚨 项目级三大铁律
1. **双向强同步**：需求/原型变更必同步 \docs/\ 与 \prototype/\
2. **严禁越界开发**：未澄清需求与原型，禁止写产品代码
3. **真交互原型**：功能原型必须可点击流转

## 📂 仓库结构规约 (Aligned with Physical Repo)
\\\
agent-learning/
├── docs/                 # 📋 需求规约 (Phase 0 Active)
├── prototype/           # 🎨 交互式原型工程 (Phase 0 Active)
├── src-tauri/           # 🔧 Tauri 后端 (⚠️ Phase 1 Reserved)
├── src-desktop/         # 🖥️ 桌面前端 (⚠️ Phase 1 Reserved)
├── release/             # 📦 构建产物 (⚠️ Phase 1 Reserved)
├── scripts/             # 🛠️ 架构治理脚本
├── AGENTS.md            # 📜 核心协作铁律 (SSOT)
└── README.md            # 📖 项目总览
\\\
"@ | Set-Content "README.md" -Encoding UTF8

Write-Host "📦 [4/初始化] 创建根 Workspace package.json" -ForegroundColor Cyan
@"
{
  "name": "agent-learning",
  "private": true,
  "version": "0.0.0",
  "workspaces": ["prototype", "src-desktop"],
  "scripts": {
    "test:proto": "npm run test --workspace=prototype",
    "sync:check": "node scripts/check-sync.js"
  }
}
